note.p:
Source: National Archives, RG 59, Central Foreign
                    Policy File, P840148–2579. Secret; Immediate; Nodis. Drafted by Sterner;
                    cleared by Stanislaus R.P. Valerga (S/S–O);
                    approved by Atherton. Sent for
                    information Immediate to the White House. Vance was in Pretoria for discussions on the Namibian question
                    with South African officials.
